{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ff98fbafa90a4ce36033b3028e76f7f77037f6067c4ed71c63035185af2c4e48", "ja": "（今日は女神に扮した紗代子のグラビア撮影だ。\nやや難航気味で、軽い休憩を挟むことになった）", "zh": "（今天是纱代子扮演女神进行写真拍摄。进展似乎不太顺利，决定中间稍微休息一下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "b0997e59210dfe8e26068cc0be57a47bd989798511e87c76e708f1169cbd5305", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\nうう、すみません。私、不甲斐なくて……。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n呜呜，对不起，都是我太没用了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dc6c15411f1af0e47859a5e6c844943edf90aa8f8ef9c3772fb267dd479db331", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。休憩して、\n気持ちを切り替えていこう。", "zh": "没事的。先休息一下，\n调整好心情再来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "9c180a6c079b504ba9da56b5c7dac2366dc569b2bd10a329479a9eec40dcc172", "ja": "豊穣の女神らしい、慈愛の表情……。\n私、どうしてもうまく掴めなくて……。", "zh": "要表现出丰收女神般慈爱的表情……我怎么都抓不住那个感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "6d55cb0c3af893b2eb73fbc90b48a961925c259cac012356509786cdf3fb7fa8", "ja": "こう、私なりに、\n全力の慈愛を表現しているつもりなんですけど……。", "zh": "像这样，我是想用自己的方式，全力表现出慈爱的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fc6c843b94a25f2208dff4beb5e4d32365b51121c3ad30b93a2031173a47af89", "ja": "全力の慈愛か。\nそれがそもそも難しそうだしな……。", "zh": "全力的慈爱啊。\n光是这个本身，感觉就已经很难了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "327adf4c7a02dfb84505654785fb7111b3db745a66e32fd986eff365652f4228", "ja": "はい、イマイチだって言われました。\nうう、うまくできない自分が、悔しいです……！", "zh": "是的，我被说成是不太行。\n呜呜，没能做好，我好不甘心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1007_p", "source_sha256": "015ee089beb3e62d7cec0e2aae714ed0fb25fe7aa310967c95e592f4c4aff2f5", "ja": "思い詰めるのはよくないぞ。休憩中なんだし……\nそうだ。ちょっとおやつでも食べようか。", "zh": "别钻牛角尖啦。现在正好是休息时间……\n有了。稍微吃点点心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "898e7114edb980d7a32390edbce4d54941da7e3d0852ddf84a2959ce9f43092b", "ja": "え？　おやつ、ですか？", "zh": "咦？要吃点心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1009_p", "source_sha256": "069df05108ffc59282993f1e9abff11ac68b2ee3628c99117419e691325fbadb", "ja": "ほら、ふかしたサツマイモがあるぞ。\nアツアツでほくほくだ！", "zh": "你看，有刚蒸好的红薯。\n热乎乎的，软糯香甜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "4a830fbd0794022201628780003f5f37db796c858f41ceb7a64262165a59e490", "ja": "あ、それって……もしかして、私がさっきの\n収穫選手権で掘ったおイモ？", "zh": "啊，那是……难道是我刚才在收获大赛里挖到的红薯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1011_p", "source_sha256": "57a2ed004a11cf558fd0a257d87d01d87bc50582f84a2ca81df3db8d8b2b0e77", "ja": "そうそう、どれも大きくていい形だな。\n味も……はふはふ、うん、抜群じゃないか！", "zh": "没错没错，每个都又大又漂亮。\n味道也……呼呼，嗯，真是棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "45708a003afb8b297fa329cae308b3053006e7b698a3d59651dbdb6598ae041b", "ja": "ふふっ。{$P$}、\n慌てて頬張りすぎですよ。", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}，您吃得太急，塞得太满了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1013_se", "source_sha256": "7d37269cd3530b9657d1d5a029bdf004162f4d31c7aefdaaf7f0c578d7d3765b", "ja": "パシャッ！　パシャッ！", "zh": "喀嚓！喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "096fddd4424e2ee342fd4de9a9c9d14b0a22fff9971faca37de7b81d8272b606", "ja": "え？　カメラマンさん……？\nあっ、すみません！　休憩終わってたんですね！？", "zh": "咦？摄影师……？\n啊，对不起！休息时间已经结束了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1015_camman", "source_sha256": "43f2c6e5a1d93d68fac57c0fd51801ed10bef973235d2d7cbb630fcf13f95145", "ja": "いいえ、まだ休憩時間ですよ！\nただ、いい表情だったものですから、つい♪", "zh": "没有，现在还是休息时间哦！\n只是你刚才的表情很棒，忍不住就……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "1ce6e699a87c92ed593b199f2a2613eb5f8d9e89ba3d399cec726a6061a6132b", "ja": "えっ？　いい表情って……\n今、私が見てたのは……あ……。", "zh": "诶？　好表情是指……\n刚才我看到的是……啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1017_camman", "source_sha256": "56a9e60bf5182280e4e2e760ceb4d8cf520f2c6e2685a8c0f084077b89103b5a", "ja": "もうすぐ再開ですけど、また今の感じで。\nよろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "马上就要重新开始了，还请继续保持现在的状态。拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "407538028dec6881b70db0a8aa5d104df84e47f49c8e9a73cc3309b97c27ae69", "ja": "はいっ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好的，请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5fdc5c6ad7430dbdc17c67b6503bc9cdd26c85fc1f65b26bb25a4993b53723b9", "ja": "よかったな、紗代子！　じゃあ再開に備えて、\n大急ぎでサツマイモを片付けて……。", "zh": "太好了，纱代子！那就为了准备重新开始，赶紧把红薯收拾掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "d52a3ee4c16f9cb55a58d97e8b2da5c38930fc3df4d1ddd9af4579a8639ab6e9", "ja": "あ、待ってください！\nあの、できれば、そのままで……。", "zh": "啊，请等一下！\n那个，如果可以的话，就保持那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0144_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "b586bd8fab8e9b6201876d2b2de86826be9fe275a1b0c29c11c766e3e4509574", "ja": "おイモ、たくさん食べててもらえると……、\nうれしいです。ふふっ♪", "zh": "如果能多吃点红薯的话……我会很开心的。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
